  "content": "This plan maps the implementation ecosystem for solar and battery storage deployment in Southeast Asia (Thailand, Vietnam, Indonesia) through 2030. It uses parallel research streams to cover: (1) institutional actors and coordination architecture, (2) country-specific regulatory/procurement barriers, (3) financing mechanisms and their effectiveness, (4) supply chain/logistics bottlenecks, (5) data system gaps — then synthesizes findings into a leverage point analysis with actionable recommendations for donor capital allocation.\n\nUncertainty is moderate (we know the domain but need specific actor-level and bottleneck-level detail), and the work is highly decomposable into parallel research streams. Using join='all' with a final synthesis task.",
